OL,3,GNEWSAReform calls for referendum over
OL,4,Amigrant housing
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK is calling for a county-wide
OL,7,Freferendum on plans to house asylum
OL,8,Fseekers at a former RAF base in
OL,9,FSuffolk.
OL,11,FThe motion will be put to Suffolk
OL,12,FCounty Council's full council meeting
OL,13,Fnext month. Reform has control of the
OL,14,Fauthority, so would expect this to
OL,15,Fsucceed.
OL,17,FThe proposal comes amid local concern
OL,18,Fover Home Office plans to convert RAF
OL,19,FBarnham, near Thetford, into
OL,20,Faccommodation for asylum seekers for a
OL,21,Fminimum of 10 years, said a Reform
OL,22,Fspokesperson.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
